Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - Michael Is Home Alone}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.31,0:00:11.55,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Kobayashi-san finally managed \Nto get some time off,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.55,0:00:16.62,Narrator,,0,0,0,,so he and his wife decided to go \Non a hot spring trip, just the two of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.39,0:00:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many years it's been \Nsince we traveled alone together.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.59,0:00:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since Michael came along, we \N haven't really been able to leave the house.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.74,0:00:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... The air's so fresh. \NThis feels great!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.83,0:00:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe we should've \Nbrought Michael with us after all?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.50,0:00:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop it already.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.49,0:00:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.67,0:00:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's the first time we've left the house \Nfor three whole days.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.49,0:00:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. \NWe left him three days' worth of food.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.64,0:00:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And we even set up two litter boxes, didn't we?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.98,0:00:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right. He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.05,0:00:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.62,0:00:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.50,0:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Turns out there are cats who like baths?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.36,0:00:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess. Michael makes a huge fuss \Nif we even try to shampoo him.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.37,0:01:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Michael's doing right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.41,0:01:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now, let's forget about Michael for a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.78,0:01:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we've got the \Ngreat outdoors all to ourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.71,0:01:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.15,0:01:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like we're Adam and Eve.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.00,0:01:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? So this must be the Garden of Eden, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.89,0:01:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Adam. The whole world belongs to just the two of us right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Isn't it good?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.52,0:01:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.67,0:01:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought he might get lonely \Nbeing all by himself for three days.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.49,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.51,0:01:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I guess he'll just have \Nto put up with it, won't he?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.31,0:01:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. It's only three days \Nin Michael's long life.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.63,0:01:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,True. We spoil him way too much as it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.32,0:02:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes we've got to teach him \Na little patience.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.66,0:02:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, we've pampered him way too much.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.79,0:02:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So in that case...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.03,0:02:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael might just get so lonely \Nhe'll have a nervous breakdown! {neurosis}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.84,0:02:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{Epstein}Michael killing himself...{no, the joke doesn't work}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.80,0:02:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding! \NWhat am I even saying?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.67,0:02:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.24,0:02:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But what if he gets excited \Nabout all that food{ for three days} and eats it all at once?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.21,0:02:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's no joke! \NGoing home {\i1}now{\i0}?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.80,0:02:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let me go! \NI'm so worried I can't even enjoy this trip!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.44,0:02:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down! \NOur Michael isn't that gluttonous a cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.80,0:02:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some confidence, for God's sake!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.67,0:02:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.24,0:02:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We've explained it to him so many times, even Michael would understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.74,0:02:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go back, okay? {to the room}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.59,0:02:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.60,0:02:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.21,0:03:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.04,0:03:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I left my cigarettes on the table \Nof our living room!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.98,0:03:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Cigarettes?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.82,0:03:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael might end up smoking cigarettes... \Neven though he's still underage!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.42,0:03:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Good stuff! {???} {likely ふぅ、うめぇ}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, dear!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.59,0:03:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.06,0:03:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let Michael turn to delinquency.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.63,0:03:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, calm down.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.00,0:03:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael's never smoked before.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.50,0:03:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why tonight \Ncould be so dangerous.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.87,0:03:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's home. He'll feel blue. {literal, could go "lonely"}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.94,0:03:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly when young people \Ngo astray most often!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.01,0:03:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's trust him. \NThere's no way our Michael would ever...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.84,0:03:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.95,0:03:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.50,0:03:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to close the bathroom door at home!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.38,0:03:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Michael's filled the tub and gone in? {? I don't understand what's the tragedy lol}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.89,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, let's go home! \NI can't stand it anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.66,0:03:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'll go grab the luggage.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.37,0:03:57.84,Narrator,,0,0,0,,While the two of them were kicking up \Nall that fuss, Michael himself was…
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.20,0:04:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.17,0:04:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! Michael! Michael! Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.93,0:04:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.30,0:04:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.77,0:04:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! You're alive!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.64,0:04:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You were lonely, weren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.90,0:04:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. \NI'll never leave you behind again!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.91,0:04:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.43,0:04:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.66,0:04:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Michael, honestly, Michael...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.85,0:05:04.67,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? \NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.67,0:05:07.19,Song,,0,0,0,,You too will be number one someday
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.19,0:05:10.61,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael?\NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.61,0:05:13.68,Song,,0,0,0,,Now which one is number one?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.68,0:05:16.20,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? Number one!
Comment: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - Poppo's Matchmaking}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.44,0:05:26.73,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Poppo's arranged marriage meeting \Nwas to take place today.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.97,0:05:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The auspicious date and clear skies today \Nseem to foretell how this story will unfold. {very poetic and flowery}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.31,0:05:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, this is Poppo-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.02,0:05:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a graduate of Nekomaneki Junior College \Nand currently helps her family with housework.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.32,0:05:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Poppo. \NNice to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.56,0:06:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.48,0:06:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinnosuke, ma'am!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.07,0:06:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A graduate of Bow-Wow University, \Ncurrently employed at Chuggin' Industries! {gabugabu = gulping down (a drink); guzzling; chugging}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.17,0:06:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, well then...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.61,0:06:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll leave it to the young couple \Nto work out the rest,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.08,0:06:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,while Poppo's parents\Nand I step out to the garden.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.44,0:06:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.45,0:06:28.82,Thought,,0,0,0,,She's beautiful...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.32,0:06:31.78,Thought,,0,0,0,,He seems so kind...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.29,0:06:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.33,0:06:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You go ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.75,0:06:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, n-no, you first.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.58,0:06:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, really, you should start.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.75,0:06:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, well then...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.00,0:06:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.17,0:06:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're very beautiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.69,0:06:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.08,0:07:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, what are your hobbies?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.62,0:07:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Running.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.49,0:07:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.02,0:07:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I love running around \Nto my heart's content in open fields!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.54,0:07:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially on cold days, \Nor when it's snowing. It's the best!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.57,0:07:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, w-what are your hobbies, Poppo-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.54,0:07:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleeping.
Comment: 10,0:07:22.03,0:07:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{dismay}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.24,0:07:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I simply love staying perfectly still!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.18,0:07:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me for a moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.39,0:07:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.12,0:07:40.56,Thought,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Honestly, a cat and a dog having an arranged\Nmatchmaking meeting was doomed from the start.{Had to put in an "fs" size command since this was showing up as a three-liner on my end. -Marty}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.56,0:07:42.38,Thought,,0,0,0,,If we just pretend this never happened...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.73,0:07:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, Poppo's going to look beautiful \Nin her bridal gown, won't she?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.40,0:07:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, of course. \NShe is our daughter, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.80,0:07:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.32,0:07:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.17,0:07:56.66,Thought,,0,0,0,,They're looking forward \Nto my wedding that much... {see me in my wedding gown}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.66,0:07:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.55,0:08:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Poppo-san, what kind of men do you like?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.35,0:08:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, someone who's good at climbing trees!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.59,0:08:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you climb trees?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.26,0:08:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it...
Comment: 10,0:08:09.11,0:08:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{What?!}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.36,0:08:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even persimmon trees? {??? kaki no ***}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.99,0:08:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,At least a wardrobe? {chest of drawers; bureau; cabinet; tansu; dresser}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.26,0:08:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you at least climb on top of the TV?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.30,0:08:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You can't?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.37,0:08:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I can't.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.37,0:08:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for a moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.94,0:08:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I hate this! \NA man who can't even climb trees...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.71,0:08:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, dear...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.02,0:08:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.95,0:08:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Poppo's wedding outfit \Nshould be a wedding dress, not a kimono.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.09,0:08:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, it has to be a traditional bunkin-takashimada headdress. {https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsunokakushi - I.... can't think of a good translation here lol}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.20,0:08:47.53,Thought,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they're already \N so excited for my marriage...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.96,0:08:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right... I can't climb trees, \Nbut I'm good at chasing and catching thieves!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.58,0:08:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Poppo-san, what do you like to do?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.00,0:08:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stealing. {thieving}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.31,0:09:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I often steal from the fishmonger's shop.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.68,0:09:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And because I'm so fast, \Nmy parents always praise me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.52,0:09:22.06,Thought,,0,0,0,,Mom, Dad, what am I supposed to do?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.96,0:09:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Those carp{s} look delicious.{carp is both singular and plural; no 's'}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.10,0:09:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,For Poppo's wedding gifts, let's include\Nsome carp{s} at least that size, served whole. {fish served whole (complete with head and tail}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.60,0:09:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.35,0:09:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just one thing I'm worried about.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.77,0:09:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Poppo's a cat, and Shinnosuke's a dog, is that it?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.71,0:09:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.05,0:09:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. Poppo will understand \Na dog's feelings and be a good wife for him.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.48,0:09:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure she can do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.92,0:09:49.49,Thought,,0,0,0,,Understanding a dog's feelings...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.49,0:09:53.36,Thought,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! \NI'll become a dog myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.36,0:09:57.81,Thought,,0,0,0,,If I become a dog, I'll be able \Nto understand Shinnosuke's feelings.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.34,0:10:06.11,Thought,,0,0,0,,I'm a dog, I'm a dog.... \NI'll think like a dog!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.32,0:10:09.29,Thought,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.71,0:10:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.78,0:10:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Poppo-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.28,0:10:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I make a good cat!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.84,0:10:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.39,0:10:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.12,0:10:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can climb trees too!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.22,0:10:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.14,0:10:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And my meow is... meowoof! Meowoof! {nyawanwan}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.90,0:10:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.93,0:10:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hopeless...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.77,0:10:36.60,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A cat and a dog.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.60,0:10:42.06,Narrator,,0,0,0,,In the end, this arranged meeting between the two didn't work out.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.84,0:10:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Meowoof! Meowoof!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.95,0:10:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.56,0:10:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\p1\c&H050D05&}m 0 0 l 640 0 640 480 0 480{\p0}
Comment: 0,0:10:48.63,0:10:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - Stakeout}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.39,0:11:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stop!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.66,0:11:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Detective Takeshita!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.26,0:11:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{???}{TLC} Stop right there! {making something up}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.99,0:11:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{??? Poli-san, ****}{TLC} You're finally here, officer!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.49,0:11:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{??? **** ano ko wo taskerunda}{TLC} We need to act now to save the hostage!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.88,0:11:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, officer! {poli-san - shortening of policeman-san - or maybe just his proper name lol}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.82,0:11:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good, we got him flanked.{よーし、まず回り込んだぞ}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.98,0:11:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where's my money?!{金はまだか？！}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.56,0:11:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Get ready, as soon as the other team jump in, that's our cues... Now!　{いいか？森たちが飛び込んだら行くぞ！今だ！}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.99,0:11:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Yamamura.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.29,0:11:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Our objective is to capture Kikuchi, \Na leader of the serial bombing group.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.10,0:11:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If Matsumoto's here, \Nthat means he's bound to show up.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.07,0:11:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Until Kikuchi appears, don't make a move.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.17,0:11:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.64,0:11:50.81,Thought,,0,0,0,,We finally found their hideout.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.81,0:11:52.71,Thought,,0,0,0,,We won't let them get away.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.71,0:11:53.10,Thought,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.92,0:11:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoo, shoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ignore the cat...{??? idk what he means by that mushimushi}{TLC} {無視無視…}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.00,0:12:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Damn it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.18,0:12:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.42,0:12:24.31,Thought,,0,0,0,,This is bad. With that cat there, it's the same \Nas pointing out that someone's here.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.81,0:12:26.26,Thought,,0,0,0,,But my cigarette...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.65,0:12:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, don't come here!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.16,0:12:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoo, shoo! Go away! Shoo, shoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.79,0:12:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.99,0:12:40.48,Thought,,0,0,0,,C-Crap...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.53,0:12:49.97,Thought,,0,0,0,,My lighter...\NLighter, lighter... Ah, found it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.80,0:12:51.74,Thought,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.07,0:12:54.99,Thought,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.68,0:12:56.99,Thought,,0,0,0,,Start working alr—
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.73,0:13:16.33,Thought,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.30,0:13:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.41,0:13:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?! Come out!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.65,0:13:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What, just a cat?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.33,0:13:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get lost already.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.84,0:13:57.81,Thought,,0,0,0,,It's a fish bone!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.97,0:14:01.72,Thought,,0,0,0,,A fish bone!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.31,0:14:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.51,0:14:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What, a cat again?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.42,0:14:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll chase you off for sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.67,0:14:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.17,0:14:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good. Don't you want it?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.67,0:14:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing it. Go after it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.06,0:14:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.60,0:14:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't come back.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.35,0:14:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Never again.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.97,0:14:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break already! \NYou're messing up my stakeout.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.87,0:14:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Matsumoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.37,0:14:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A-A cop! I knew it! {で、刑事（デカ）め、やっぱりいたな！}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.82,0:14:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Give yourself up quietly!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.34,0:14:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that... \Nwhen I take this cat hostage!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.88,0:14:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.35,0:15:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, please clear the way!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.36,0:15:24.41,Thought,,0,0,0,,Next time I see that damn cat, I'll kill him! {???? *** koroshite yaru} {今度あったら殺してやる}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.31,0:15:42.01,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? \NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.01,0:15:44.51,Song,,0,0,0,,You too will be number one someday
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.51,0:15:47.95,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael?\NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.95,0:15:51.02,Song,,0,0,0,,Now which one is number one?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.02,0:15:53.74,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? Number one!
Comment: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - The Midnight Battle}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.87,0:16:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.67,0:16:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be locked in until tomorrow morning. \NI'm counting on you for the rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.87,0:16:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you take the keys with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.61,0:16:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get up at five tomorrow \Nto go to Yuriko's wedding.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.21,0:16:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Going all the way to a deserted island \Npast Okinawa just to have a wedding?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.35,0:16:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you've got some fanciful friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.27,0:16:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you expect?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.12,0:16:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{She says it's a match brought about by scuba diving.} She said they met while scuba diving.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.52,0:16:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei, hurry up! \NThe assistants have already left.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.33,0:16:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be on our way, ma'am!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.49,0:16:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.93,0:16:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'd better hurry and get ready myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.27,0:16:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've set the alarm for five on the dot.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.04,0:16:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, time to sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.91,0:16:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.36,0:16:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Michael? \NWhat's over there?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.33,0:17:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear me! \NWith rain like this, they'll all get soaked.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.49,0:17:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, just for one night...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.59,0:17:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.53,0:17:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must be quiet.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.26,0:17:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, goodnight!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.21,0:17:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all too heavy! \NI can't sleep like this!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.35,0:17:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that face.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.18,0:17:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get up early tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.42,0:17:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.90,0:17:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not enough! {??}　{several variations of こんなんじゃ足りないよ}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.85,0:17:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, if it's not enough, \Nwe'll ask for more. {/demand}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.43,0:18:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.52,0:18:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, you're saying that's not enough, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.36,0:18:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could that be at this hour of night?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.68,0:18:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Kobayashi.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.47,0:18:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, Yuriko? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.24,0:18:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're calling from a hotel in Okinawa?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.24,0:18:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You had a fight with your boyfriend?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.54,0:18:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? He called you {\i1}that{\i0}?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.29,0:18:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Men are such brutes! {??? too lazy to find that chapter in the manga}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.78,0:18:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, girl!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.73,0:18:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.22,0:18:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that for?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.02,0:18:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's nothing. \NSo then, what happened next?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.19,0:18:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are too damn noisy!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.93,0:18:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No! I wasn't talking to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.97,0:19:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, honestly... \NWhy can't you bear with it just a little?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.22,0:19:05.61,Thought,,0,0,0,,I've only got three hours left...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.03,0:19:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you guys. If you wake me up again, \Nthere'll be hell to pay, ya hear?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.68,0:19:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What's your problem?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.57,0:19:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too noisy!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.81,0:19:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.47,0:20:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened here?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.51,0:20:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Dear?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.11,0:20:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I overslept! \NTh-This is terrible!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.00,0:20:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.16,0:20:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're not a towel?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.94,0:20:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.00,0:20:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the phone.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.10,0:20:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You answer it!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.23,0:20:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.47,0:20:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Kobayashi.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.37,0:20:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.41,0:20:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.14,0:20:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Michael. \NDear, I'll leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.04,0:20:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a second.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.71,0:20:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.73,0:20:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? I'm in a hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.20,0:20:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuriko-san just called.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.79,0:20:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night's fight is still going on, \Nso they're calling off the wedding today.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.41,0:20:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.61,0:21:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{What's this, seriously?} You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.36,0:21:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.08,0:21:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.90,0:21:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.24,0:21:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who stayed up \Nall night working, you know.
